    12347                                   find first bf_fin-ob-trn where bf_fin-ob-trn.trn-doc-code = bf_trn-doc.doc-code and v-sum > (bf_trn-doc.tot-fact - bf_trn-doc.discnt-rubl) no-error.
    12348                                   if not available bf_fin-ob-trn then do:
